{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017f2pVBrMD18Si1F68ebT4g","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is bad. Round 0 went from 276ms to 416ms — a significant regression! And LogUp GKR went from 533ms to 746ms! STARK excl trace went from 1407ms to 1763ms.\n\nThis looks like the same memory pressure problem that hit the previous pre-allocation attempt. The pre-allocated buffers are consuming too much GPU memory, causing contention in other phases.\n\nLet me think about what went wrong. The max buffer sizes are likely very large (driven by the few large AIRs), and we're pre-allocating those max sizes for all 8 threads.\n\n\nI need to check the actual memory usage from the metrics to confirm. The real problem is that I'm pre-allocating for the maximum AIR across all work items, which wastes memory on the many smaller AIRs. I could use a threshold like the 95th percentile and fall back to dynamic allocation for the outliers, or just pre-allocate smaller buffers since I already have the size check in place.\n\nLooking at the buffer size distribution, I see the issue more clearly now. The GKR pre-allocation worked because each thread used roughly 100MB, totaling around 800MB across 8 threads. But for Round 0, each thread could need up to 640MB for `max_temp_bytes`, and with 4 buffers of intermediates, that's 8 threads × 640MB × 4 — far too much. The actual intermediates size depends on `buffer_size`, `skip_domain`, `num_x`, and `num_cosets`, so small AIRs stay small while large ones balloon.\n\nInstead of pre-allocating for the worst case across all work items, I should use a percentile-based threshold — something like the 90th percentile — so most AIRs get pre-allocated buffers and avoid mutex contention, while the few outliers fall back to dynamic allocation. Let me add some debug logging to see what the actual buffer size distribution looks like.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":938,"cache_read_input_tokens":117566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":938},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e7b52780-6e9b-4892-943d-0d0679c1a1bd","uuid":"4184d566-983a-4703-8009-c359c396dec8"}
